# Demo Patch 2 — pip-audit: Vulnerable Dependency (CVE)

## What it demonstrates
pip-audit finds a known CVE in a pinned dependency version. The gate
blocks the merge with exit code 1.

## Trigger
Downgrade Flask to a version with known CVEs.

--- a/app/requirements.txt
+++ b/app/requirements.txt
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
-Flask==3.1.3
+Flask==3.0.3
 gunicorn==22.0.0

## Expected gate output
Found 2 known vulnerabilities in 1 package
Name    Version    ID                Fix Versions
flask   3.0.3      PYSEC-2026-2151   3.1.3

Error: Process completed with exit code 1.

## Fix
Upgrade to Flask==3.1.3 (or newer) to resolve the CVE.